# Not autostarted - hotplug handling (mirror/extend picker, highest
# refresh rate, laptop-as-leader on disconnect) now lives in
# scripts/monitor-watch.py + scripts/monitor-popup.sh, wired into
# hyprland.lua's autostart. kanshi has no native mirror directive and
# can't prompt interactively, so it isn't a fit for that job.
#
# Kept around for manual use (`kanshi -c ~/.config/kanshi/config`) or as
# a starting point for a location with a fixed, no-prompt layout - e.g.
# a specific desk you always extend to the same way:
#
# profile work-desk {
# 	output eDP-1 enable mode preferred position 0,0
# 	output "Dell Inc. DELL U2720Q ABCD1234" enable mode 3840x2160@60Hz position 1280,0
# }
